return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Boshqa yo\'l bilan ulanib bo\'lmaydigan xostlar uchun Zinn Digital® tortib ola oladigan yagona arxivga ushbu WordPress saytini — fayllar va ma\'lumotlar bazasini — to\'playdi. Uni siz TARK ETHAYOTGAN saytga o\'rnating, bitta tugmani bosing va havolani Zinn® migratsiyatingizga qo\'ying.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Bu saytni Zinn® ga ko‘chirish','Move to Zinn®'=>'Zinn® ga o\'tkazish','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Buni amalga oshirish uchun ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Bu saytdagi hamma narsani — uning fayllari va ma\'lumotlar bazasini — bitta arxivga to\'playdi va sizga uning maxsus havolasini beradi. Ushbu havolani Zinn® saytidagi migratsiyangizga qo\'ying va biz saytni ko\'chirib o\'tamiz. Siz havolani ulashishni tanlamaguningizcha, bu yerdagi hech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Bunga ehtiyojingiz bo\'lmasligi mumkin. Agar eski xostingiz sizga FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk yoki DirectAdmin\'ni taqdim etsa, Zinn® ushbu ma\'lumotlar yordamida saytni to\'g\'ridan-to\'g\'ri ko\'chirib kelishi mumkin va siz ushbu plagindan butunlay voz kechishingiz mumkin — bu tezroq ishlaydi va keyinchalik hech qanday ortiqcha narsa qolmaydi. Bularning birortasi ham mavjud bo\'lmagan taqdirda, shundan foydalaning.','Room on this server'=>'Bu serverdagi bo\'sh joy','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Bu server bizga qancha disk maydoni bo\'sh ekanligini aytmaydi, shuning uchun biz buni siz uchun tekshira olmaymiz. Paketga taxminan %s kerak bo\'ladi. Agar yetarli joy borligiga ishonchgingiz komil bo\'lmasa, uni o\'rnatishdan oldin hosting provayderingizdan so\'rang — joyi tugab qolgan server saytni ishdan chiqaradi.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Paket taxminan %1$s talab qiladi va bu serverda %2$s bo\'sh joy mavjud.','Build the package'=>'Paketni tuzish','Building…'=>'Qurilmoqda...','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Hozir arxivlanmoqda: %1$s. Hozirgacha %2$s ta fayl, %3$s tasi yozildi.','your files'=>'sizning fayllaringiz','your database'=>'sizning ma\'lumotlar bazangiz','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Cancel and delete'=>'Bekor qilish va o‘chirish','Your package is ready'=>'Paketingiz tayyor','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Ushbu havolani nusxalab, Zinn®\'dagi migratsiyangizga qo\'ying:','Size: %s.'=>'Hajmi: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Bu havolani paroldek saqlang. Unga ega bo\'lgan har qanday shaxs butun saytingizni, shu jumladan ma\'lumotlar bazangizni ham yuklab olishi mumkin. Paket u yaratilganidan keyin 24 soat o\'tib avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi — migratsiya tugashi bilanoq uni o\'zingiz ham o\'chirib tashlang.','Delete the package now'=>'Paketni hozir o\'chirish','Build it again'=>'Qaytadan qurish','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Bu serverda PHP’ning ZipArchive kengaytmasi mavjud emas, shuning uchun bu yerda paket yaratib bo‘lmaydi. Xosting provayderingizdan buni yoqishini so‘rang yoki uning o‘rniga FTP yoki SSH ma’lumotlaringiz bilan Zinn®’dagi migratsiya formasidan foydalaning.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Yuklashlar katalogingiz ichida papka yaratib bo\'lmadi, shuning uchun paketni yozish uchun joy yo\'q. wp-content/uploads yozish uchun ruxsat etilganligini tekshiring.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Hech qanday paket tuzilmayapti. Avval birini boshlang.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Paket faylini yozish uchun ochib bo‘lmadi.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Maʼlumotlar bazasini eksport qilish imkoni boʻlmadi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan shaxslar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni sotib oling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.']];